{"seq":3,"slug":"variable-inspection","title":"变量检查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/variable-inspection","wordCount":960,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"变量检查\">变量检查</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>变量检查是把「内存中的裸字节」翻译成「屏幕上的人类可读值」的过程。它遵循一条固定的三级展开路径：<strong>stackTrace（有哪些栈帧）→ scopes（这一帧有哪些作用域）→ variables（作用域里有哪些变量）</strong>。整条链路靠一个核心机制串联：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>variablesReference</td>\n<td>0 表示叶子，非零表示可继续展开（构成变量树）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>evaluate</td>\n<td>在指定上下文中求值任意表达式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>context</td>\n<td>控制求值是否允许副作用（watch/repl/hover）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解变量检查的关键是看清 <code>variablesReference</code> 如何把扁平的作用域列表变成可无限展开的树——这也是编辑器变量面板懒加载的实现基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"作用域与栈帧\">作用域与栈帧</h2><p>当程序暂停时，编辑器通过 <code>stackTrace</code> → <code>scopes</code> → <code>variables</code> 的层级请求获取执行状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface StackTraceArguments {&#10;  threadId: number;&#10;  startFrame?: number;&#10;  levels?: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface StackFrame {&#10;  id: number;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  source?: Source;&#10;  line: number;&#10;  column: number;&#10;  endLine?: number;&#10;  endColumn?: number;&#10;  canRestart?: boolean;&#10;  presentationHint?: &#39;normal&#39; | &#39;label&#39; | &#39;subtle&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ScopesArguments {&#10;  frameId: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Scope {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  presentationHint?: &#39;arguments&#39; | &#39;locals&#39; | &#39;registers&#39;;&#10;  variablesReference: number;&#10;  namedVariables?: number;&#10;  indexedVariables?: number;&#10;  expensive: boolean;&#10;  source?: Source;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StackTraceArguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  threadId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  startFrame</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  levels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StackFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  line</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  column</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  endLine</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  endColumn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  canRestart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  presentationHint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'normal'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'label'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'subtle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ScopesArguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  frameId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Scope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  presentationHint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'arguments'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'locals'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'registers'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  variablesReference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  namedVariables</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  indexedVariables</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expensive</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;    participant DA as 调试适配器&#10;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: stackTrace (threadId: 1)&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: StackFrame[] [{id:0, name:handleRequest}, {id:1, name:main}]&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: scopes (frameId: 0)&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Scope[] [{name:Locals, ref:1}, {name:Closure, ref:2}]&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: variables (variablesReference: 1)&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Variable[] [{name:req, value:Request{...}, ref:3}]&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: variables (variablesReference: 3)&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Variable[] [{name:url, value:/api/users}]\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant E as 编辑器\n    participant DA as 调试适配器\n\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: stackTrace (threadId: 1)\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: StackFrame[] [{id:0, name:handleRequest}, {id:1, name:main}]\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: scopes (frameId: 0)\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Scope[] [{name:Locals, ref:1}, {name:Closure, ref:2}]\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: variables (variablesReference: 1)\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Variable[] [{name:req, value:Request{...}, ref:3}]\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: variables (variablesReference: 3)\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Variable[] [{name:url, value:/api/users}]</pre><p>作用域类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>presentationHint</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>arguments</td>\n<td>参数</td>\n<td>函数参数列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>locals</td>\n<td>局部变量</td>\n<td>当前栈帧的局部变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>registers</td>\n<td>寄存器</td>\n<td>CPU 寄存器值（底层调试）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(无)</td>\n<td>闭包</td>\n<td>闭包捕获的变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(无)</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>全局变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>expensive: true</code> 的作用域（如全局变量）不会自动展开，需要用户手动点击。这避免了加载大量全局状态的性能问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"变量树\">变量树</h2><p>变量通过 <code>variablesReference</code> 形成树状结构。叶子节点的 <code>variablesReference</code> 为 0，非零值表示该变量可以展开查看子属性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Variable {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  value: string;&#10;  type?: string;&#10;  presentationHint?: VariablePresentationHint;&#10;  evaluateName?: string;&#10;  variablesReference: number;&#10;  namedVariables?: number;&#10;  indexedVariables?: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Variable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  presentationHint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VariablePresentationHint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  evaluateName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  variablesReference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  namedVariables</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  indexedVariables</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SCOPE[&quot;Locals (ref: 1)&quot;] --&gt; USER[&quot;user (ref: 3)&quot;]&#10;    SCOPE --&gt; COUNT[&quot;count: 42 (ref: 0)&quot;]&#10;    SCOPE --&gt; ITEMS[&quot;items (ref: 4)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    USER --&gt; NAME[&quot;name: &#39;Alice&#39; (ref: 0)&quot;]&#10;    USER --&gt; AGE[&quot;age: 30 (ref: 0)&quot;]&#10;    USER --&gt; ADDR[&quot;address (ref: 5)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    ADDR --&gt; CITY[&quot;city: &#39;Beijing&#39; (ref: 0)&quot;]&#10;    ADDR --&gt; ZIP[&quot;zip: &#39;100000&#39; (ref: 0)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    ITEMS --&gt; I0[&quot;0: &#39;apple&#39; (ref: 0)&quot;]&#10;    ITEMS --&gt; I1[&quot;1: &#39;banana&#39; (ref: 0)&quot;]&#10;    ITEMS --&gt; I2[&quot;2: &#39;cherry&#39; (ref: 0)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    SCOPE[\"Locals (ref: 1)\"] --&gt; USER[\"user (ref: 3)\"]\n    SCOPE --&gt; COUNT[\"count: 42 (ref: 0)\"]\n    SCOPE --&gt; ITEMS[\"items (ref: 4)\"]\n\n    USER --&gt; NAME[\"name: 'Alice' (ref: 0)\"]\n    USER --&gt; AGE[\"age: 30 (ref: 0)\"]\n    USER --&gt; ADDR[\"address (ref: 5)\"]\n\n    ADDR --&gt; CITY[\"city: 'Beijing' (ref: 0)\"]\n    ADDR --&gt; ZIP[\"zip: '100000' (ref: 0)\"]\n\n    ITEMS --&gt; I0[\"0: 'apple' (ref: 0)\"]\n    ITEMS --&gt; I1[\"1: 'banana' (ref: 0)\"]\n    ITEMS --&gt; I2[\"2: 'cherry' (ref: 0)\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>variablesReference</td>\n<td>0 = 叶子节点，非零 = 可展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>namedVariables</td>\n<td>命名子变量数量（对象属性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>indexedVariables</td>\n<td>索引子变量数量（数组元素）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>evaluateName</td>\n<td>可在 evaluate 请求中使用的表达式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>memoryReference</td>\n<td>变量的内存地址引用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 当 <code>indexedVariables</code> 较大时（如长数组），客户端应使用分页请求：通过 <code>variables</code> 请求的 <code>start</code> 和 <code>count</code> 参数按需加载。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"表达式求值\">表达式求值</h2><p><code>evaluate</code> 请求允许在调试上下文中求值任意表达式，支持多种上下文场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface EvaluateArguments {&#10;  expression: string;&#10;  frameId?: number;&#10;  context?: &#39;watch&#39; | &#39;repl&#39; | &#39;hover&#39; | &#39;clipboard&#39; | &#39;variables&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface EvaluateResponse {&#10;  result: string;&#10;  type?: string;&#10;  presentationHint?: VariablePresentationHint;&#10;  variablesReference: number;&#10;  namedVariables?: number;&#10;  indexedVariables?: number;&#10;  memoryReference?: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EvaluateArguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expression</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  frameId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'watch'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'repl'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hover'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'clipboard'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'variables'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EvaluateResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  presentationHint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VariablePresentationHint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  variablesReference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  namedVariables</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  indexedVariables</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  memoryReference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    EVAL[evaluate 请求] --&gt; CTX{context}&#10;    CTX --&gt;|watch| WATCH[监视面板]&#10;    CTX --&gt;|repl| REPL[调试控制台]&#10;    CTX --&gt;|hover| HOVER[鼠标悬停]&#10;    CTX --&gt;|clipboard| CLIP[复制到剪贴板]&#10;    CTX --&gt;|variables| VAR[变量面板内联]\">graph TD\n    EVAL[evaluate 请求] --&gt; CTX{context}\n    CTX --&gt;|watch| WATCH[监视面板]\n    CTX --&gt;|repl| REPL[调试控制台]\n    CTX --&gt;|hover| HOVER[鼠标悬停]\n    CTX --&gt;|clipboard| CLIP[复制到剪贴板]\n    CTX --&gt;|variables| VAR[变量面板内联]</pre><p>各上下文的行为差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>context</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>副作用允许</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>watch</td>\n<td>监视面板表达式</td>\n<td>不推荐</td>\n<td>持续监视变量或表达式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>repl</td>\n<td>调试控制台输入</td>\n<td>允许</td>\n<td>执行代码、修改变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hover</td>\n<td>鼠标悬停变量</td>\n<td>不允许</td>\n<td>快速查看变量值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>clipboard</td>\n<td>复制值操作</td>\n<td>不允许</td>\n<td>生成适合粘贴的字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>variables</td>\n<td>变量面板修改</td>\n<td>允许</td>\n<td>用户在变量面板中设置新值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"watch-表达式\">Watch 表达式</h2><p>Watch 表达式是持续在监视面板中显示的表达式，每次暂停时自动重新求值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class WatchManager {&#10;  private watches: Map&lt;string, string&gt; = new Map();&#10;&#10;  addWatch(expression: string): void {&#10;    this.watches.set(expression, &#39;&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async evaluateAll(frameId: number, session: DebugSession): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    for (const [expression] of this.watches) {&#10;      const result = await session.evaluate({&#10;        expression,&#10;        frameId,&#10;        context: &#39;watch&#39;,&#10;      });&#10;      this.watches.set(expression, result.result);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WatchManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> watches</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  addWatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expression</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.watches.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(expression, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluateAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">frameId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">session</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DebugSession</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">expression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.watches) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">evaluate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        expression,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        frameId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        context: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'watch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.watches.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(expression, result.result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;    participant DA as 调试适配器&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;E: 添加 Watch: &quot;user.name&quot;&#10;    Note over E: 保存到 Watch 列表&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped event&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: evaluate(&quot;user.name&quot;, context: &quot;watch&quot;)&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: { result: &quot;&#39;Alice&#39;&quot;, type: &quot;string&quot; }&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;U: 监视面板: user.name = &#39;Alice&#39;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: continue&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped event (下一个断点)&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: evaluate(&quot;user.name&quot;, context: &quot;watch&quot;)&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: { result: &quot;&#39;Bob&#39;&quot;, type: &quot;string&quot; }&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;U: 监视面板: user.name = &#39;Bob&#39; (值变化高亮)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant E as 编辑器\n    participant DA as 调试适配器\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;E: 添加 Watch: \"user.name\"\n    Note over E: 保存到 Watch 列表\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped event\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: evaluate(\"user.name\", context: \"watch\")\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: { result: \"'Alice'\", type: \"string\" }\n    E-&gt;&gt;U: 监视面板: user.name = 'Alice'\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: continue\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped event (下一个断点)\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: evaluate(\"user.name\", context: \"watch\")\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: { result: \"'Bob'\", type: \"string\" }\n    E-&gt;&gt;U: 监视面板: user.name = 'Bob' (值变化高亮)</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动求值</td>\n<td>每次暂停时自动重新求值所有 Watch 表达式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值变化检测</td>\n<td>编辑器高亮显示与上次不同的值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>表达式无效时显示错误信息而非崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作用域感知</td>\n<td>在不同栈帧上下文中求值结果可能不同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内存读取与反汇编\">内存读取与反汇编</h2><p>对于系统级调试，DAP 支持原始内存读取和指令级反汇编。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ReadMemoryArguments {&#10;  memoryReference: string;&#10;  offset?: number;&#10;  count: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface DisassembledInstruction {&#10;  address: string;&#10;  instructionBytes?: string;&#10;  instruction: string;&#10;  symbol?: string;&#10;  location?: Source;&#10;  line?: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadMemoryArguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  memoryReference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  offset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DisassembledInstruction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  address</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  instructionBytes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  instruction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  symbol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  location</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  line</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 内存视图&#10;        MEM[&quot;0x7fff5fbff8c0: 48 65 6c 6c 6f 20 57 6f | Hello Wo&quot;]&#10;        MEM2[&quot;0x7fff5fbff8c8: 72 6c 64 00 00 00 00 00 | rld.....&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 反汇编视图&#10;        ASM1[&quot;0x100003f50: push rbp&quot;]&#10;        ASM2[&quot;0x100003f51: mov rbp, rsp&quot;]&#10;        ASM3[&quot;0x100003f54: sub rsp, 0x20&quot;]&#10;        ASM4[&quot;0x100003f58: call 0x100003f80  ; handleRequest&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 内存视图\n        MEM[\"0x7fff5fbff8c0: 48 65 6c 6c 6f 20 57 6f | Hello Wo\"]\n        MEM2[\"0x7fff5fbff8c8: 72 6c 64 00 00 00 00 00 | rld.....\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 反汇编视图\n        ASM1[\"0x100003f50: push rbp\"]\n        ASM2[\"0x100003f51: mov rbp, rsp\"]\n        ASM3[\"0x100003f54: sub rsp, 0x20\"]\n        ASM4[\"0x100003f58: call 0x100003f80  ; handleRequest\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>请求</th>\n<th>前提条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存读取</td>\n<td>readMemory</td>\n<td>supportsReadMemoryRequest</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反汇编</td>\n<td>disassemble</td>\n<td>supportsDisassembleRequest</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指令级单步</td>\n<td>next/stepIn</td>\n<td>granularity: &quot;instruction&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指令断点</td>\n<td>setInstructionBreakpoints</td>\n<td>supportsInstructionBreakpoints</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 内存读取返回的 <code>data</code> 是 Base64 编码的原始字节。反汇编的 <code>resolveSymbols</code> 参数让适配器在反汇编中解析函数名，使输出更可读。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((变量检查))&#10;    作用域&#10;      locals 局部变量&#10;      arguments 参数&#10;      closure 闭包&#10;      expensive 延迟加载&#10;    变量树&#10;      variablesReference 层级&#10;      命名变量 vs 索引变量&#10;      分页加载大数组&#10;    表达式求值&#10;      watch / repl / hover&#10;      context 控制副作用&#10;      frameId 栈帧上下文&#10;    Watch 表达式&#10;      自动重新求值&#10;      值变化高亮&#10;      错误容错&#10;    底层检查&#10;      内存读取 Base64&#10;      反汇编视图&#10;      指令级调试\">mindmap\n  root((变量检查))\n    作用域\n      locals 局部变量\n      arguments 参数\n      closure 闭包\n      expensive 延迟加载\n    变量树\n      variablesReference 层级\n      命名变量 vs 索引变量\n      分页加载大数组\n    表达式求值\n      watch / repl / hover\n      context 控制副作用\n      frameId 栈帧上下文\n    Watch 表达式\n      自动重新求值\n      值变化高亮\n      错误容错\n    底层检查\n      内存读取 Base64\n      反汇编视图\n      指令级调试</pre><ul>\n<li>变量检查通过 <strong>stackTrace → scopes → variables</strong> 的三级请求层层展开。</li>\n<li>变量通过 <code>variablesReference</code> 形成<strong>树状结构</strong>，0 表示叶子节点，非零表示可展开。</li>\n<li><strong>evaluate</strong> 请求支持 watch/repl/hover 等多种上下文，<code>context</code> 参数控制是否允许副作用。</li>\n<li><strong>Watch 表达式</strong>在每次暂停时自动重新求值，编辑器高亮显示值的变化。</li>\n<li><strong>内存读取和反汇编</strong>支持系统级调试，需要适配器声明相应的能力。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"变量检查","id":"变量检查"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"作用域与栈帧","id":"作用域与栈帧"},{"level":2,"text":"变量树","id":"变量树"},{"level":2,"text":"表达式求值","id":"表达式求值"},{"level":2,"text":"Watch 表达式","id":"watch-表达式"},{"level":2,"text":"内存读取与反汇编","id":"内存读取与反汇编"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"断点与单步执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/breakpoints-and-stepping"},"next":{"title":"高级调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/advanced-debugging"}}